# Storage-abstraction plan PR1 — the fastapi and dagster Docker build
# contexts widened from their own subdirectory to this one (./src), so
# Docker can COPY the sibling georag_object_storage path dependency.
# Docker reads .dockerignore from the context root, so the former
# src/fastapi/.dockerignore and src/dagster/.dockerignore are merged here.

**/.git
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.venv
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/htmlcov
**/dist
**/*.egg-info
**/.claude
**/tests/fixtures

# fastapi-specific — from the former src/fastapi/.dockerignore.
# 2026-06-03 sweep: keep the build context out of the bytes graveyard.
# - fastapi/C:            Stray dir created by a Windows uv invocation that
#                         stripped the drive colon. Buildkit chokes on the
#                         path shape ("invalid file request") so it's
#                         excluded defensively in case it returns.
# - fastapi/models/       Downloaded HF / SBERT model weights (e.g.
#                         bge-small-domain-ft, ~1.8 GB). Models live in
#                         HF_HOME at runtime, never baked in.
# - fastapi/bench_results/  Local benchmark output (per-run JSON).
# - fastapi/retrieval_threshold_sweep.csv  Local eval scratch file.
# - fastapi/run_eval*.py  One-shot eval drivers; not imported by the app.
fastapi/C:
fastapi/models/
fastapi/data/
fastapi/bench_results/
fastapi/retrieval_threshold_sweep.csv
fastapi/run_eval*.py

# NOTE: docker/fastapi.Dockerfile.dockerignore and
# docker/dagster.Dockerfile.dockerignore override this file entirely for
# their respective builds (BuildKit per-Dockerfile ignore precedence) and
# additionally exclude the sibling service's whole subtree. This file
# remains as the fallback for any build path that doesn't pick those up.
# Keep the three files in sync when adding excludes.
